 marathon is gonna be but you forget to  enjoy just going for a run I do love  agile of a shared value system you're  already talking about your faith you're  talking about who you want to be what do  you want any other partner that's  awesome it's all good stuff in rich  stuff if you want to get married after  four months knock your lights out man as  I often tell people on this channel your  friends your family if they're not in  your box they don't get a vote man you  get to decide who you listen to but I'll  tell you if you want to get married  after four months the deck is stacked  against you because you know where the  finish line is man you don't know how to  enjoy the person on the way you can't  learn that kind of stuff in books you  can't learn that kind of stuff in four  months time so my recommendation  whatever it's worth is to slow down  become friends first laughs first  getting water balloon fights together go  wrap somebody's house with toilet paper  like he's doing your kid  eat together go for walks together slow  down slow down and if you value the  wisdom of your community of your family  seek that wisdom out and if they know  you as a person who makes quick  decisions and it's always jumping into  the first thing they're gonna take to  slow down or if they know her and they  say whoa she jumps into things  impulsively and they gonna tell you they  slow down that's what your community is  for but if they don't get a vote they  don't get a vote  and if you want to get married let me  know all high-five you brother and I'll  be supporting you all the way and by the  way I got married at 24 - my wife was 23  but we knew each other for five years  and I've been with the same woman for a  long time a long time and I'm still  learning things about her that I didn't  know I thought I did I didn't know  there's no pressure on you man  exhale you found an awesome girl man  that's so good but you've got a lifetime  ahead of you continue getting to know  